# Third-party checkouts. None of these are ours to publish, and together they are
# most of the directory by weight (~750 MB). `scripts/fetch_prior_art.sh` re-clones
# every one of them by URL at the pinned commit, so the survey stays reproducible
# without vendoring someone else's history into this repo.
semif/
edge0/
offload_projects/
vendor/

# The SemIf patch itself IS published, as a diff plus the complete files, under
# patch/. That is deliberate: semif/ is a clone of TheoLeeCJ/SemIf, and pushing it
# here would either carry foreign history or silently fork it.

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.uv-setuptools-*.lock
uv-setuptools-*.lock

# Model weights. 20 GB each; never in git. Download per SETUP.md.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.sha256.json

# Local scratch
.claude/
pytest-of-scribe/
.pytest_cache/
*.log

# Results that were measured wrong and deliberately discarded. Kept out of the
# repo because a file named INVALID-*.jsonl is a trap for a reader who greps for
# results/ and does not notice the prefix. The findings they produced are recorded
# in docs/SEMIF_LLAMACPP_SSD.md instead.
INVALID-*.jsonl
